#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WILSON.WILSON_ALCHEMY_9_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WILSON.WILSON_ALCHEMY_9_DESC"
msgid "Transform 2 Beard Hair into Spider Silk.\nTransform 2 Spider Silk into Beard Hair."
msgstr "将2个胡须转换为蜘蛛丝\n将2个蜘蛛丝转换为胡须"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WILSON.WILSON_ALCHEMY_8_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WILSON.WILSON_ALCHEMY_8_DESC"
msgid "Transform 2 Spider Glands into Mosquito Sack.\nTransform 2 Mosquito Sacks into Spider Gland.\nTransform 2 Chitin into Weevole Carapace.\nTransform 2 Weevole Carapace into Chitin."
msgstr "将2个蜘蛛腺体转换为蚊子血囊。\n将2个蚊子血囊转换为蜘蛛腺体。\n将2个甲壳质转换为象鼻鼠虫壳。\n将2个象鼻鼠虫壳转换为甲壳质。"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGSHOULDERS_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGSHOULDERS_DESC"
msgid "Add stony armor or tin suit to the King's statuesque shoulders for greater stoutness in your merm soldiers."
msgstr "为国王的雕塑般的肩膀上添加石甲/铁制护肩，让你的鱼人士兵更加强壮。"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGTRIDENT_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGTRIDENT_DESC"
msgid "Offer Trident or Pugalisk Wand, and your merms will attack with the deftness of three."
msgstr "为国王献上翘鼻蛇怪权杖/三叉戟，你的鱼人将以三连拍的方式灵巧攻击。"

#. STRINGS.CITY_PIG_STOREOWNER_ACCEPT_ITEM_SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CITY_PIG_STOREOWNER_ACCEPT_ITEM_SPOILED"
msgid "Eww! This is spoiled! Well, I'll give you one oinc for it, but don't tell anyone!"
msgstr "呸，都烂了！最多给你一枚咕噜币。可别跟别人说啊！"

