msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "Most seeds want a flowerpot. This one wants the mouth of a ruin."
msgstr "普通种子找花盆。这颗倒好，得给它找个遗迹入口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "My pockets held considerably more money on the way in."
msgstr "进店前钱袋还挺沉的。逛了一圈，怎么就瘪了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "My pockets held considerably more money on the way in."
msgstr "进店前钱袋还挺沉的。逛了一圈，怎么就瘪了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "If I sit perfectly still, does the world do the traveling?"
msgstr "我坐着没动，怎么就换了个世界？难道动的是世界？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "I recognize the seat. That still leaves rather a lot of pieces."
msgstr "椅面我认得。剩下这么多零件都是干什么的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "I could swear its shadow just curled up."
msgstr "我敢发誓，它的影子刚才卷起来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "For the impact test, I'll need a target. And earplugs."
msgstr "要做撞击实验，我需要一个靶子。还有一副耳塞。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "It put a dent in my workbench. The pellet looks fine."
msgstr "我的工作台凹了一块。这颗弹丸倒是好端端的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "My nose says it's medicine. My tongue seconds the motion."
msgstr "闻着像药。我尝尝……嗯，苦得很，猜对了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "Sweet on the first bite, sour on the second. Better repeat the experiment."
msgstr "第一口甜，第二口酸。这个实验值得多做几次。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "I'm fairly sure those legs didn't come with the fish."
msgstr "据我观察，这条鱼下锅前应该没长腿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "One leaf would fill my biggest beaker with gel!"
msgstr "光这一片叶子的汁，就能装满我最大的烧杯！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "I was going to take a sample of the gel. Then I got close enough to smell it."
msgstr "我本想取点芦荟汁。闻这味儿，还是算了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I can see why it needed the WHOLE garden bed."
msgstr "难怪一个萝卜就占了一整块菜地。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "When the skin's the only solid part, I think I'll skip the taste test."
msgstr "就剩一层萝卜皮还算硬。我就不尝了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "Same shelf, same goods. At last, a variable I can control!"
msgstr "这货架以后总摆同一样东西。哈，这就叫控制变量！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "It floats! Now to see what it fetches from the Pig King."
msgstr "它还浮得起来！接下来试试猪王肯出什么价。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "Gravity seems to be in excellent working order."
msgstr "举得我胳膊都酸了。看来重力没出毛病！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "A little fan can move a surprising amount of fog."
msgstr "这么小一只风扇，居然能赶跑这么大一团雾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "The pollen stays on that side, my nose stays on this side."
msgstr "这滤网能挡住花粉，我总算不用打喷嚏了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Roots below, shoot above. I think I know which end to plant."
msgstr "芽朝上，根朝下。嗯，这回肯定种不反！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Such little seeds for a plant with such big opinions about being touched."
msgstr "这么小的籽，长出来的荨麻倒挺有脾气，一碰就扎人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "It's put down roots. I'll mark its height right here."
msgstr "它扎下根了。我在这儿画道线，看看它长多快。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "No change since my last measurement. I'll try again in a warmer season."
msgstr "还是跟上回量的一样高。等天暖了，我再来量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Time for a soil experiment. Let's try a patch of sand."
msgstr "该做个土壤实验了。先换块沙地试试。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Two new leaves! I can count them from here, thank you."
msgstr "又长了两片叶子！我站远点也数得清，省得扎手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Winter seems to have put my nettle experiment on ice."
msgstr "荨麻一到冬天就不长了。我的实验得等开春再做。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Where did I find the grown ones? Right, the rainforest!"
msgstr "我在哪儿见过长成的荨麻来着？对，雨林里！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "Crumbly soil, droopy leaves. Just add water!"
msgstr "土干得一碰就散，叶子也蔫了。得浇水！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "An ocular instrument carved from moon rock! Where is its focal point?"
msgstr "用月岩雕了只眼睛！光照进去，会聚在哪儿呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "One seed can restore a whole ruin? I must see the process for myself!"
msgstr "一粒种子就能让整座遗迹恢复原样？我得亲眼看看是怎么回事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "A pity they display the merchandise but give no tours of the factory."
msgstr "货架上的东西倒是齐全。真想去工厂看看是怎么做出来的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "A pity they display the merchandise but give no tours of the factory."
msgstr "货架上的东西倒是齐全。真想去工厂看看是怎么做出来的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "A stationary vehicle! I should like to take a reading at both ends of the journey."
msgstr "椅子一动不动，人却到了另一个世界！我得把出发和到达时的读数比一比。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "Excellent, it comes disassembled! I can examine the mechanism at my leisure."
msgstr "太好了，送来时就是散件！正好看看里头的机关是怎么装的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "Does the pellet carry the appendage or merely summon it?"
msgstr "这条触手是藏在弹丸里的，还是打出去才召来的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "A percussion test! Quite prudent to observe this one through my goggles."
msgstr "正好拿来做撞击试验！容我先戴上护目镜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "I should retrieve a spent specimen and examine the deformation."
msgstr "得捡一颗打过的回来，看看这合金撞扁了多少。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "If I could isolate the active ingredient, I might dispense with the bitterness."
msgstr "要是能单独提取起药效的成分，说不定就不用吃这份苦了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "A remarkable glaze. If only it adhered less firmly to my notebook."
msgstr "这鱼的浇汁真不错。可惜粘在笔记本上，就没那么讨人喜欢了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "A transverse slice should establish precisely what the cook put inside."
msgstr "横着切一刀，就知道厨师往鱼里塞了什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Remarkable fluid pressure. One incision ought to yield a generous sample."
msgstr "瞧这叶子鼓的！开个小口，就够我取一瓶芦荟汁了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "The tissue has liquefied. Luckily, I brought a specimen jar."
msgstr "叶肉都烂成水了。幸好我带了样品瓶。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "How many ordinary radishes went into that much root? I'll need my scales."
msgstr "这一个能顶多少个普通萝卜？得拿秤来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Even the core is soft. How quickly did the decay travel inward?"
msgstr "连萝卜芯都软了。从外皮烂到里头花了多久？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "Excellent. I can order the very same specimen again if anything happens to the first."
msgstr "太好了。头一个样品要是让我弄坏了，还能叫店家再进个一样的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "An ideal scale model. I wonder if the Pig King would lend me a testing tank."
msgstr "这小船正适合做实验。不知猪王肯不肯借我个水槽？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "With its mass established, this would make an admirable counterweight."
msgstr "先称称这哑铃有多重。以后缺个配重，正好用得上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Forced convection! Now, how far from the rotor does the fog close in again?"
msgstr "风扇把雾吹开了！我得量量，离开风扇多远，雾又会聚回来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "I should inspect the pollen trapped in the filter under magnification."
msgstr "我得用放大镜看看，这张滤网拦下了哪些花粉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "A viable cutting, with its own compact reserve of starch."
msgstr "这苗能活。看，块茎里还存着淀粉呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Such minute seeds. I nearly polished them off my lenses!"
msgstr "荨麻籽可真小！落在镜片上，我差点当灰擦了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "New growth at the tip. My transplant appears to have taken."
msgstr "顶上冒新芽了。看来这棵树移栽活了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Growth appears seasonal. I'll leave a marker and return when it's warm."
msgstr "看来它得等天暖了才长。我先做个记号，到时候再来看看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "An unsuitable substrate. Let's repeat the trial in sandy soil."
msgstr "这土不合适。换块沙地，再试一次。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Already producing those fine hairs. Where is my hand lens?"
msgstr "这么小就长出细毛了。我的放大镜呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "No measurable growth all winter. I'll take another reading in spring."
msgstr "从入冬到现在，一点儿也没长。等开春再量一量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "I must have overlooked something in the rainforest soil. Back it goes."
msgstr "雨林里的荨麻长得好。先把它移回去，再看看两边的土差在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "Wilted already? I'll increase the water supply and take fresh readings."
msgstr "这就蔫了？我得多浇点水，再量量它长了多少。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "Hey, moon rock. Kinda weird having you watch me nap."
msgstr "嘿，月岩。你这么盯着，我打个盹都怪别扭的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "One seed puts the whole anthill back? Take the afternoon off, little ants."
msgstr "一颗种子就能让蚁丘恢复原样？小蚂蚁们，下午歇着吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "There's gotta be somewhere to put my feet up in a shop this big."
msgstr "店这么大，总有个地方能让我坐下歇歇脚吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "There's gotta be somewhere to put my feet up in a shop this big."
msgstr "店这么大，总有个地方能让我坐下歇歇脚吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "I can visit another world sitting down? Scoot over."
msgstr "坐着就能去别的世界？往边上挪挪呗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "Aw. I was kinda hoping the chair part came put together."
msgstr "啊，我还指望椅子送来就能坐呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "Hey, little shadow arm. Personal space, okay?"
msgstr "嘿，影子里的小触手，咱俩别挨这么近，好吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "Pops when it hits. There goes my quiet afternoon."
msgstr "打中就炸啊。唉，这下睡不成午觉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "Smooth little lump of metal. Nice weight in my palm."
msgstr "滑溜溜的小金属弹，掂在手心还挺舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "One little pinch, buddy. I'd like to be able to taste the rest of my lunch."
msgstr "这调料苦，放一小撮就好。我还想尝出菜本来的味儿呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "Pass me the bit of carp with the honey on it."
msgstr "帮我夹块鲤鱼呗，要那块挂着蜜的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "A leg tucked in my fish fillet. Sweet, I only need one fork."
msgstr "鱼排里还裹了块腿肉。一叉子下去，两样都吃得着。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I could paddle that aloe leaf right past the break."
msgstr "这片芦荟叶够大，我都能趴在上头划过浪头了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Aw, mush. My foot went straight through the leaf."
msgstr "哎，烂透了。一脚就把叶子踩穿了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I can roll this radish home, right? Rolling I can do."
msgstr "这么大的萝卜，能一路推着滚回家吧？那可比扛着轻松多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "It rolled halfway home, then... splat. Poor radish."
msgstr "萝卜才滚到半路就……啪叽，烂成一摊了。真可惜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "Here's some oincs. Save me a trip and restock that same one?"
msgstr "给你咕噜币，下回还进这种货呗？省得我跑别家。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "One wave first, little boat. Then it's off to trade with the Pig King."
msgstr "先让这艘小船冲个浪，再去找猪王换东西呗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "Heavy. I liked it better when the ground was holding it."
msgstr "这哑铃真沉。还是搁地上吧，地又不会手酸。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Walk with me. This little breeze keeps the fog off both of us."
msgstr "一起走呗。这股小风刚好替咱俩吹开雾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "Let the filter catch the pollen. I'll just smell the flowers."
msgstr "花粉交给滤网。我就负责闻花香。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Let's get those roots outta my hands and into some dirt, buddy."
msgstr "小树苗，在我手里可扎不了根。给你找块地吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Hey, little nettle seed. You don't sting yet, do you?"
msgstr "嘿，小荨麻籽。你现在还不扎手吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Your roots look comfy down there. Guess you're staying."
msgstr "根都扎下去了。看来你在这儿住得挺舒服嘛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Grow when the warm season rolls in, little buddy. Neither of us is in a hurry."
msgstr "等天暖了再长呗，小树。咱们都不急。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Bet you'd dig the swirls in that painted sand."
msgstr "要不搬去彩绘沙地？那儿的花纹你准喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey, a little green leaf. Mind if I sit by you?"
msgstr "哟，小绿叶。介意我坐你旁边吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Sleep right through winter, little dude. I'd do it too."
msgstr "小荨麻，睡过这个冬天再长吧。我也想这么过冬。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Rainforest dirt. That's more your scene, huh?"
msgstr "换块雨林的土吧，小荨麻。你在那儿才长得好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "Another splash? Yeah, I got you."
msgstr "再来点水？行，给你浇上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "When the last camper looked away, the stone eye... Hey! Who turned it to face me?"
msgstr "最后一个队员一转身，那只石眼就……哎？谁把它转过来对着我了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "If this grows the ruins back, I'll have to draw my map in pencil."
msgstr "要是这颗种子能让遗迹恢复原样，地图可得用铅笔画，方便改！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Woby sniffed out the shop. Now she wants to sniff all three rooms."
msgstr "沃比闻着味儿找到了这家店。现在她要把三间屋子挨个儿闻一遍！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Woby sniffed out the shop. Now she wants to sniff all three rooms."
msgstr "沃比闻着味儿找到了这家店。现在她要把三间屋子挨个儿闻一遍！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "A whole new world and I don't even have to get up?"
msgstr "坐上这把椅子就能去另一个世界？一步路都不用走？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "Chair assembly seems like a funny way to start an expedition."
msgstr "出发探险的头一件事竟然是拼椅子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "My ammo's waving at me. Hi, little tentacle!"
msgstr "我的弹丸在跟我招手。你好啊，小触手！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "First the ping, then the pop! That's how I know I hit it."
msgstr "先是叮，再是砰！听声儿就知道打中了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "Same size as a pebble. Way heavier in my ammo pouch."
msgstr "跟石子一样大，装进弹袋可沉多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "This bitter stuff wards off poison! I'll keep it in the first aid tin, well away from the cocoa."
msgstr "这苦调料能防毒，放急救盒正好。可别把它当成可可粉冲着喝！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "With this in my belly I bet I could beat Woby through the fog. Ready, girl?"
msgstr "吃完这条鱼，我在雾里没准能跑赢你呢。沃比，比一场？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "I'm counting legs on a fish. This is already a good campfire story."
msgstr "我正在数一条鱼有几条腿。今晚篝火边有故事讲了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I could camp in the shade of that aloe leaf!"
msgstr "这片芦荟叶底下够我搭帐篷了，还能遮太阳！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Woby, leave it! I know rolling in it looks fun."
msgstr "沃比，别碰！我知道你很想在那堆烂芦荟里打滚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "If we hollowed this radish out, would it float?"
msgstr "把这颗大萝卜挖空，它能当船吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "It looked solid. Then my boot went right through it."
msgstr "这萝卜看着还挺结实。结果我一脚就踩穿了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "The shopkeeper will restock this if we pay. Same supply stop on the way back, Woby!"
msgstr "收了咕噜币，店家就会再进这种货。沃比，回程咱们还来这儿补给！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "You could practice all six knots on this! Well, maybe if you had smaller fingers."
msgstr "能在这艘小船上练六种绳结呢！呃，手指头得再小点才行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "One rep! That's counting when I picked it up."
msgstr "举了一下！嗯，从地上捡起来那下也算。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Fog drill! Stick with the robot and nobody falls behind."
msgstr "雾中行军演习！跟紧机器人，谁也不会掉队。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "It catches pollen! My sleeve was getting pretty gross."
msgstr "这滤网能挡花粉！我总算不用拿袖子擦鼻涕啦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "I'll carry the little tree. Somebody else bring the shovel!"
msgstr "我来抱小树！谁帮忙拿一下铲子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "One nettle seed. Better give it a pocket of its own."
msgstr "一颗荨麻籽。还是单给它腾个兜吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Look, it stays upright even when I let go!"
msgstr "看，小树苗扎根啦！我松开手它都站得稳稳的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "I'll mark it on my map! We can measure it in summer, or when the dry or lush season rolls around!"
msgstr "我先在地图上做个记号。等夏天、旱季或繁茂季，再来量量树苗长高了多少！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Let's try that painted sand. I can find it on the map!"
msgstr "去那片彩绘沙地试试吧。我能在地图上找到！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Green leaves already! I'll sketch them before they get bigger."
msgstr "这就冒绿叶了！我得赶在叶子长大前把它们画下来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "It's taking the winter off. I wish we did that at school."
msgstr "荨麻苗整个冬天都放假。要是我们学校也放这么久就好了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "I've seen these nettles in the rainforest! Let's plant this one there."
msgstr "我在雨林里见过这种荨麻！咱们把苗挪到那儿种吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "Hang on, I packed water! Knew I'd need it."
msgstr "这棵荨麻该浇水啦。看，我就说带上水壶有用吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "I turned that stone eye to face the wall. Or was that the last one?"
msgstr "我明明把这只石眼转过去对着墙了。等等，难道转的是上一只？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "Even that stair I broke on the way out? Oh, I do hope it remembers that stair."
msgstr "这粒种子能修好遗迹？希望我踩塌的那级台阶也能修好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Three rooms. I've been through four. Oh, that's the entrance again."
msgstr "才三间屋，我怎么逛了四间？噢，这间是我刚进来的那间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Three rooms. I've been through four. Oh, that's the entrance again."
msgstr "才三间屋，我怎么逛了四间？噢，这间是我刚进来的那间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "A seat to the next world? I'll take it. My feet are killing me."
msgstr "坐着就能去另一个世界？这位子我要了。我的脚都快疼死了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "Where did I set the seat? Ah. I'm sitting on it."
msgstr "我把座板放哪儿了？啊，就在我屁股底下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "Was that my shadow? Mine doesn't usually have tentacles."
msgstr "刚才那是我的影子？我的影子平时可没长触手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "It'll burst the instant it hits. I'll stand over here, then."
msgstr "一打中就炸。那我还是站远点吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "Lovely alloy. A pity to sling it away when I could use it for parts."
msgstr "这么好的合金，做个表里的零件多合适。就这么打出去？可惜了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "That stopped a sneeze just as I was setting the minute hand. I'll take two."
msgstr "还好有这味药，刚才拨分针时才没打喷嚏。给我留两份。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "Honey on the carp! I'll lick the fork before the vinegar catches up."
msgstr "鲤鱼上有蜂蜜！趁醋的酸劲还没上来，让我先舔舔叉子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "Two legs with my fish? I'm rather glad I met it after it was cooked."
msgstr "这鱼还配了两条腿？幸好端到我面前的时候已经煮熟了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "If I'd known it got this big, I'd have picked the aloe yesterday."
msgstr "早知道芦荟能长这么大，我昨天就该摘了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Oh dear. I could smell that aloe long before I found it."
msgstr "隔老远就闻见臭味了。原来是这棵芦荟！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "If I hollowed out that radish, I could fit all my watches inside."
msgstr "把这萝卜掏空，怕是能装下我所有的表。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "I put a finger through the radish. That answers the freshness question."
msgstr "手指头都戳进萝卜里了。得，不用问新不新鲜了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "I'll pay the oincs now. I'd like this same item on my next visit."
msgstr "咕噜币我现在就付。下回过来，我还要买同样的货。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "The Pig King will take this little boat? And here I've been dusting it."
msgstr "猪王肯收这艘小船？那我这些年不是白给它擦灰了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "I could've lifted that steel weight yesterday. I was younger yesterday."
msgstr "昨天我还举得动这块钢呢。我昨天可比现在年轻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Walk beside WX and the fog won't delay us. I call the left side."
msgstr "跟着机器人走，就不用在雾里耽误时间了。它左边的位置归我！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "A pollen filter! Ever tried setting a watch in mid-sneeze?"
msgstr "花粉滤网！你试过打着喷嚏对表吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "I should plant this little tuber tree while I remember why I'm carrying it."
msgstr "趁我还记得自己为什么拿着这棵树苗，赶紧把它种了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Nettle seeds. Which pocket did I promise myself I'd keep them in?"
msgstr "是荨麻籽。我打算装在哪个口袋来着？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Good, it's taken root. That's one less thing to come back for."
msgstr "好，扎根了。这下不用再专门跑回来一趟了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "I'm early. The little tree's waiting for the warm season."
msgstr "看来我来早了。得等天暖和些，小树才会长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Of course. The tuber trees I remember grew in painted sand."
msgstr "想起来了。我记得那些块茎树都长在彩绘沙地上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "New green leaves already? I must have been away longer than I thought."
msgstr "这就长新叶了？我到底走了多久？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "After winter, then. I wish all my appointments were this easy to move."
msgstr "那就过了冬天再来。要是所有约会都能这么轻松地改期就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Rainforest turf! Why do I remember these things after I've planted them?"
msgstr "雨林地皮！怎么每次都是种下去才想起来？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "I watered it tomorrow, didn't I? Where's the can?"
msgstr "我不是浇过水了吗？哦，那是明天的事。水壶呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "Even carved in stone, I know that look. Too much salt?"
msgstr "刻在石头上我也认得这眼神。盐放多了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "A whole ruin from one seed? And I thought my sourdough starter was lively."
msgstr "一粒种子就能让整座遗迹重现？我养的那罐酵种可没这么大本事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Three rooms to shop in. Now, where did I smell cinnamon?"
msgstr "这家店有三间屋子呢。刚才的肉桂香是从哪间飘来的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Three rooms to shop in. Now, where did I smell cinnamon?"
msgstr "这家店有三间屋子呢。刚才的肉桂香是从哪间飘来的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "A seat for one. I hope there's room for my pot in the next world."
msgstr "单人座。希望下个世界放得下我的锅。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "These pieces make a chair? I'd welcome a recipe."
msgstr "靠这些零件就能拼出把椅子？要是有张食谱就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "That tentacle should stay well away from my calamari."
msgstr "那根触手可得离我的炸鱿鱼圈远一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "It bursts on impact. Walter, shall I move the good china?"
msgstr "这弹丸打中东西会炸。沃尔特，要我先把好瓷盘收起来吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "Ah, solid alloy. I'd hoped they were silver sugar pearls."
msgstr "啊，是合金的。我还以为是银色糖珠呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "Just a pinch. Let the bitter note come through at the end."
msgstr "撒一小撮就好，咽下去时尝到一丝苦味就够了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "The vinegar cuts the honey just enough to let the carp shine."
msgstr "这点醋刚好收住蜜的甜，还尝得出鲤鱼的鲜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "Tender fish, a bite of leg meat... voilà, two textures on one fork."
msgstr "鱼排嫩，腿肉有嚼头。妙，一叉子下去，两种口感都有了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "There's enough clear flesh in one leaf for a jug of punch."
msgstr "一片芦荟能刮出这么多透亮的叶肉，够调一大壶果汁了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "That sour smell has gone right through the aloe."
msgstr "整棵芦荟都沤酸了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Imagine the paper-thin rounds I could slice from this!"
msgstr "想想看，这大萝卜切出来的薄片，得有多漂亮！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "My thumb sank right in. A radish ought to snap."
msgstr "拇指一按就陷下去了。新鲜萝卜掰开，那可是咔嚓一声。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "A few oincs to keep this in stock? That'll save me changing the menu!"
msgstr "花点咕噜币，请店家下回还进这种货，我就不用临时改菜单了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "Wouldn't a slice of lemon make a fine little sail?"
msgstr "切一片柠檬给这艘小船当帆，正合适！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "After a few lifts, even my stockpot should feel light."
msgstr "举上几回，以后端汤锅也该觉得轻了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "The robot's fan will keep us moving through the fog. If only that breeze smelled of supper!"
msgstr "有机器人身上的风扇帮忙，我们在雾里也能走得快些。要是风里再带点饭香就好了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "Ah, a pollen filter! I can smell dinner again."
msgstr "啊，花粉滤掉了！总算又闻得到晚饭的香气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "First a home for this sapling, then we can talk tubers."
msgstr "先找块地把树苗栽好，再惦记吃块茎的事吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "A nettle seed! I nearly put it through the pepper mill."
msgstr "哎，这是荨麻籽！我差点当胡椒粒给磨了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "The roots have taken. I'll come back for the tubers."
msgstr "根扎稳了。等结了块茎我再来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Even tubers have their season. The little tree's in no hurry, and neither is my pot."
msgstr "块茎也讲时令。眼下小树还不肯长，我的锅倒不急着用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "I'd start with desert soil for this one."
msgstr "要栽这棵树，我会先试试沙漠里的土。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Such tender green tips on my little nettle."
msgstr "看看这棵荨麻苗，刚冒出来的叶尖多嫩！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Fresh nettles are off the menu till winter's over."
msgstr "得等冬天过去，菜单上才有鲜荨麻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "The missing ingredient is rainforest soil."
msgstr "我知道少了哪味料了！这棵荨麻得种在雨林的土里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "A drink for the nettle before I fill the pot."
msgstr "锅里一会儿再添水，先给这棵荨麻浇一瓢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "A moonstone eye, wide as mine on opening night."
msgstr "首演那晚，我的眼睛也瞪得跟这只石眼一样圆！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "From such a speck the fallen halls shall rise again!"
msgstr "这么小一粒种子，就能让倒塌的遗迹重新立起来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Where are the shields? Thou hast given the hats a whole wall!"
msgstr "店家，盾牌呢？帽子倒是挂了整整一面墙！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Where are the shields? Thou hast given the hats a whole wall!"
msgstr "店家，盾牌呢？帽子倒是挂了整整一面墙！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "I take my seat. Raise the curtain on another realm!"
msgstr "我坐好了！为下一个世界拉开大幕吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "My throne lies in pieces and the overture has begun!"
msgstr "开场的乐声都响了，我的宝座怎么还是一堆零件？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "Come, shadow! My arm against thy tentacle!"
msgstr "来，暗影！伸出触手，跟我扳手腕！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "A clap of thunder where this little shot strikes!"
msgstr "好一颗小弹丸！打中敌人，炸得比雷还响！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "A wee iron fist for the sling."
msgstr "弹弓也有一只小铁拳了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "Bitter on the tongue. Let pollen and venom try me now!"
msgstr "这调料真苦。花粉、毒液，有本事就一起上！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "A coat of honey! Even the carp wears golden armor to the feast!"
msgstr "这条鲤鱼浇上了蜂蜜，倒像披了身金甲！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "A feast of fish, garnished with more meat!"
msgstr "好一盘鱼肉，连配菜也是腿肉！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Blades as broad as shields! Alas, all leaf."
msgstr "这叶子长得跟盾牌一样宽！可惜啊，再大也是菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "A fallen heap of slime. The aloe's saga ends."
msgstr "芦荟都烂成泥了。这就是它的最后一幕！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Who heaved this red boulder from the earth?"
msgstr "哪位勇士从土里拔出了这块红巨石？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "At last, a radish with a fearsome battle stench."
msgstr "这萝卜都不用扔，光是臭味就能把敌人熏跑！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "My coin, the mayor's seal. Refill this shelf in kind!"
msgstr "镇长有令，咕噜币我出！店家，下回还得进这种货！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "A ship fit for the Pig King's tub! What shall he bid?"
msgstr "这小船放在猪王的澡盆里正好！陛下肯出什么价？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "Up, iron! My spear arm could use the exercise."
msgstr "铁疙瘩，起！正好练练我拿战矛的胳膊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Stay close to our iron warrior, comrades! With that fan, no mist shall slow our march!"
msgstr "战友们，跟紧装了风扇的机器人！我们在雾里也能大步前进！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "A fine sieve. No pollen shall spoil my high note!"
msgstr "有这层滤网挡着，花粉休想害我唱高音时打喷嚏！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Where shall I set thee down, wee bearer of tubers?"
msgstr "块茎树苗啊，我该把你栽在哪儿呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "A sting yet slumbers in this tiny seed."
msgstr "别小看这粒荨麻籽，长大了可会蜇人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Stand fast, sapling! Thy roots hold firm."
msgstr "站稳了，小树！好，根扎得够牢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Not your season yet, little tree. When the warmth returns, the stage is yours!"
msgstr "小树，还没到你登场的季节。等天暖了，再长个痛快！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Volcanic earth would suit thy roots."
msgstr "这块地不适合你，小树。到火山上去扎根吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "A little crest of green! The nettle lives."
msgstr "看这棵荨麻苗，头顶那几片绿叶多精神！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Bide thy time. Even winter must yield."
msgstr "等冬天退场，这棵荨麻就能接着长了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Back to thy rainforest soil, little nettle."
msgstr "小荨麻，给你换个阵地！咱们去雨林里扎根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "A drink for the parched little warrior!"
msgstr "土都干了。给这位小勇士浇点水！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "An audience of one, carved in moon rock. What a chilly reception."
msgstr "唯一的观众是月岩雕的。难怪冷场。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "I clear the ruins, and this puts them back. Typical."
msgstr "我才清完整座遗迹，一颗种子就能把它变回原样。真体贴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Three salesrooms, and I can still hear the same pig."
msgstr "这店有三间屋。躲进哪一间，都听得见那头猪的嗓门。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Three salesrooms, and I can still hear the same pig."
msgstr "这店有三间屋。躲进哪一间，都听得见那头猪的嗓门。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "I should like to see where this chair goes before I sit in it."
msgstr "我想先看看这把椅子通往哪儿，再决定要不要坐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "Some assembly required. Where's my assistant?"
msgstr "还得自己装。我的助手呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "A tentacle on cue. Who taught the boy that trick?"
msgstr "触手倒是准时登场了。谁教沃尔特这一手的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "It announces every hit with an explosion. Rather ruins a discreet exit."
msgstr "一打中就炸。这么大动静，我还怎么悄悄退场？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "A well-cast alloy shot. Nicely balanced, too."
msgstr "铸得精细的合金弹丸。分量也恰到好处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "A little bitter. I've swallowed worse for the sake of an uninterrupted performance."
msgstr "苦了点。为了演出时不打喷嚏，更难咽的我也吃过。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "Whoever arranged those fins understands the value of an entrance."
msgstr "鱼鳍这么一摆，连条鲤鱼上桌都像主角登场。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "The fish was quite presentable before someone tucked those legs in."
msgstr "这鱼原本卖相不错。谁非要往鱼肚子里塞腿？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "One leaf would keep me in aftershave for a year."
msgstr "每天刮完胡子抹一点，这片芦荟够我用一年。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "It's seeping through my handkerchief."
msgstr "这烂芦荟的汁都把我的手帕浸透了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "A radish that requires a carving knife. Fetch the good silver."
msgstr "吃个萝卜还得用切肉刀。拿我那把银柄的来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "I could smell that radish from the next room."
msgstr "我在隔壁房间就闻到这萝卜的味儿了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "A signature and a modest fee. Surely even a pig can restock the same item."
msgstr "字我签，钱我付。猪老板，卖完了还进这种货，记住了吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "His Majesty collects toy boats? I may yet turn a profit."
msgstr "猪王陛下还收玩具船？看来我还有得赚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "I leave the heavy lifting to my shadows. Suit sleeves are expensive."
msgstr "这种重活自然有影子代劳。西装袖子可不便宜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "I'll walk beside the automaton. It parts the fog quite neatly."
msgstr "这机器人吹开雾的本事不错。我就走它旁边吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "A fine pollen filter. I'd like one for my dressing room."
msgstr "花粉滤得真干净。我的化妆间也该装一个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Its roots are catching in my cuff. Someone dig a hole."
msgstr "根须都钩住我袖口了。来个人挖个坑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Nettle seeds. I shall sow them without removing my gloves."
msgstr "种荨麻籽？那我这副手套就不摘了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "The roots have taken. I can dismiss the gardener."
msgstr "根已经扎稳。园丁可以回去了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "It prefers a warmer season. So do I."
msgstr "它偏爱暖和的时节。这点倒跟我一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "I recognize the type. Try a patch of desert soil."
msgstr "我认得这种树。换块沙漠土试试。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Already an excellent reason to wear gloves."
msgstr "苗才这么点大就扎手了。幸好我戴了手套。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "I can scarcely blame it for taking the winter off."
msgstr "它要歇一整个冬天。我倒也能体谅。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "It wants rainforest turf. Naturally, I brought a nettle and left the forest."
msgstr "荨麻得种在雨林土里。怎么，还指望我把整片雨林搬来？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "The nettle is wilting. Where did I put the watering can?"
msgstr "荨麻蔫了。我把洒水壶搁哪儿了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "Just the one eye? It can borrow some of ours if it likes."
msgstr "它只有一只眼睛？它要是愿意，可以跟我们借几只呀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "If we use this seed to put the anthill back the way it was, will the ants notice?"
msgstr "我们用这颗种子把蚁丘变回原样，蚂蚁们会发现吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Could we look at the high shelves too? We promise not to climb on anything!"
msgstr "上头的架子也让我们瞧瞧好吗？我们保证不爬上去！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Could we look at the high shelves too? We promise not to climb on anything!"
msgstr "上头的架子也让我们瞧瞧好吗？我们保证不爬上去！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "If we sit really still, do we get up in a whole other world?"
msgstr "我们乖乖坐好，再站起来的时候，就到另一个世界啦？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "We can hold all the chair bits while you fit them together!"
msgstr "你来拼椅子，我们帮你拿着零件！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "That shadow tentacle's waving at us! Um, should we wave back?"
msgstr "那条暗影触手在跟我们招手！呃，我们也挥挥手吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "First it hits, THEN it pops. We can do the sound effects!"
msgstr "先打中，再炸开。我们会配音！啪，嘭！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "That metal ball goes clink against all the others in our pocket."
msgstr "这颗金属丸跟我们兜里别的弹丸碰在一起，叮当响。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "It's so bitter! If we both hold our noses, who's going to hold the spoon?"
msgstr "这么苦，我们俩都想捏着鼻子吃。那谁来拿勺子呀？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "We licked the honey off the carp. Ooh, the rest is sour!"
msgstr "我们把鲤鱼上的蜂蜜舔掉了。咿，剩下的好酸！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "If our fish has two legs, does it need two little shoes?"
msgstr "我们的鱼排有两条腿，是不是还缺两只小鞋呀？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "We could hide behind that aloe leaf. Can you see our feet?"
msgstr "我们能躲在这片芦荟叶后面。你看得见我们的脚吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "We tried to lift a leaf and the rotten bit came off on us."
msgstr "呀！才掀起一片叶子，烂芦荟就糊了我们一身！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Can we roll this radish home? You give it a push and we'll steer!"
msgstr "我们把大萝卜滚回家吧？你来推，我们管方向！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "There goes our radish ball. The flies can have their turn now."
msgstr "我们的萝卜球烂了。这下轮到苍蝇玩了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "Here are our oincs. Could you stock another one, please? We'd like one for our friend too!"
msgstr "咕噜币给您！卖完了再摆个一样的，好吗？我们想给朋友也买一个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "We promised the Pig King a trade. Just one more sail around the tub?"
msgstr "我们答应拿小船跟猪王换东西了。能先让它在澡盆里再漂一圈吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "We've got plenty of arms. How many does it take to lift this?"
msgstr "我们胳膊多。要用几只才举得起它呀？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Stay in the fan's breeze! Then we can all race through the fog!"
msgstr "待在风扇吹得到的地方！这样大家就能在雾里赛跑啦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "Look at all the pollen on the filter! That could've been in our nose!"
msgstr "看滤网上沾了多少花粉！差点儿全进我们鼻子了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "We'll carry the little tree. Can you dig a hole for its roots?"
msgstr "我们抱住树苗，你帮忙挖个坑，好吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Careful with the nettle seeds. We lost one in our fur already."
msgstr "小心那些荨麻籽。已经有一颗掉进我们的毛毛里找不着了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Look, it's standing up all by itself! The roots must be holding on."
msgstr "看，不用我们扶也站得住了！根已经扎进土里啦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Our little tree has a growing season too? We'll come visit when it's warm!"
msgstr "小树也要等自己的季节呀？等天暖了，我们再来看你！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Maybe it likes the stripy sand. We can take it there!"
msgstr "它会不会喜欢那片彩绘沙地呀？我们带它去试试吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi, little green nettle! We remember when you were a seed."
msgstr "你好呀，小绿苗！你还是荨麻籽的时候我们就认识你啦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Once winter's over you can grow again. Will you get taller than our boots?"
msgstr "等冬天过了，你就能接着长啦。以后会不会比我们的靴子还高呀？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Oops, wrong dirt! Shall we get you some from the rainforest, little nettle?"
msgstr "哎呀，土弄错了！小荨麻，我们给你换点雨林里的土，好不好？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "Let's give the roots another drink. We can carry the can together."
msgstr "土都干啦！我们一起去提水壶，再给小苗浇点水吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "A stone eye with no lid. It can never close, even for a moment."
msgstr "这只石眼连眼皮都没刻。想闭一会儿也闭不上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "One little seed, and the ruins get a second chance. I envy them."
msgstr "只要这么一粒种子，整座遗迹就能恢复原样。真让人羡慕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Three rooms of things their owners could bear to part with."
msgstr "整整三间屋子，装的都是主人舍得卖掉的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Three rooms of things their owners could bear to part with."
msgstr "整整三间屋子，装的都是主人舍得卖掉的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Another world is only a seat away. Come along, Abigail."
msgstr "坐上这把椅子，就能去另一个世界。一起走吧，阿比盖尔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "I found the pieces of a chair. Our departure can wait."
msgstr "椅子还没拼好。看来我们得晚点再走了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "A tentacle feeling about in the dark. Perhaps it's lonely."
msgstr "一条触手在暗处摸索。也许它寂寞了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "Such a quiet little pellet, until it strikes and bursts."
msgstr "这颗弹丸在手里安安静静的。一打中东西，就会炸开。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "The metal will scarcely feel the blow. I pity what it hits."
msgstr "这颗金属弹大概感觉不到疼。我倒可怜挨打的那个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "The flowers tried to cheer me. Their pollen made me cry. Pass the bitter herbs."
msgstr "花儿想逗我高兴，花粉倒惹得我直掉眼泪。给我一点儿苦香料吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "The honey on my tongue fades before the sour does."
msgstr "舌尖的蜜味先散了，酸味还在。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "They gave the fish a pair of legs. It still didn't get away."
msgstr "这条鱼倒是配上了两条腿。可惜还是没能逃出餐盘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "There's enough balm in one leaf for a ward of patients."
msgstr "这么大一片芦荟叶，挤出的汁够一屋子伤员用了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "All that healing sap, and nothing to save the aloe itself."
msgstr "那么多能疗伤的汁液，却没能救下芦荟自己。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "So much of it grew where no one could see."
msgstr "这萝卜在地下长了这么大，一直没人看见。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "It still wears its red skin. Underneath, it's gone quite soft."
msgstr "那层红皮看着还好，可轻轻一按就塌了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "A few oincs, and the shopkeeper replaces what's missing. How simple."
msgstr "给店主几枚咕噜币，卖掉的货就能照原样补回来。真容易啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "Abigail used to puff out her cheeks and blow on our little boats. I only had to hold the sail."
msgstr "从前我们玩小船，总是阿比盖尔鼓着腮帮子吹风。我只要扶好帆就行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "At least I can set this weight down."
msgstr "至少手里这块铁，我随时都能放下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Walk beside me. The fan leaves us a narrow path through the fog."
msgstr "和我一起走吧。靠近风扇，雾就挡不住我们的路了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "Flower dust settles on the filter like ashes."
msgstr "滤网上积的花粉，像一层细灰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Its roots hang loose over my fingers. I should find it a home."
msgstr "小树的根搭在我手上。给你找块土，安个家吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "A handful of seeds, each with a little sting in its future."
msgstr "一捧荨麻籽。等长出叶子，每一棵都会扎手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Its roots have taken hold. Something here means to stay."
msgstr "树苗扎下根了。总算有一样东西打算留下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "It's not your season for new leaves yet. I'll wait with you, little tree."
msgstr "现在还不是你长新叶的时候。小树，我陪你等。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Its roots would sooner settle in desert sand."
msgstr "这棵树苗更喜欢沙漠里的土。给它换个地方吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "A little green against all that dark earth."
msgstr "这么黑的土里，冒出了一点绿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Sleep through the winter, little nettle. I'll look in on you."
msgstr "睡过这个冬天吧，小荨麻。我会来看你的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "A piece of rainforest floor might ease its homesickness."
msgstr "小荨麻大概想家了。给它换块雨林的地皮吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "The soil crumbles at a touch. I'll fetch you some water."
msgstr "土一碰就碎了。我去给你取点水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "A second pair of eyes for the cockpit. Well, half a pair."
msgstr "让这块月岩帮我看航线，我就多了一双眼睛。哦，半双。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "This puts the ruins back? Good. I missed a turn back there."
msgstr "这颗种子能让遗迹恢复原样？好啊，上回有条岔路我还没走过。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Three rooms of supplies. I brought one bag. Swell."
msgstr "三间屋子都堆满了货，我偏偏只带了一个包。妙啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Three rooms of supplies. I brought one bag. Swell."
msgstr "三间屋子都堆满了货，我偏偏只带了一个包。妙啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "A front-row seat to a whole new world. Dibs!"
msgstr "去新世界，还能坐头排？这位子我占了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "I see the seat. Any of these bits a seat belt?"
msgstr "椅座找到了。这堆零件里哪个是安全带？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "A pocket-sized shadow tentacle. It can have its own pocket."
msgstr "能揣兜里的暗影触手。行，给它单腾个兜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "It pops on impact. I can score that shot by ear."
msgstr "听见炸响，我就知道这一发打中了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "Solid alloy. I'll know where it landed by the dent."
msgstr "实心合金。找着凹坑就知道它落哪儿了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "A pinch keeps the pollen off and weighs less than a spare handkerchief. Into the pack it goes."
msgstr "一小撮就能挡花粉，还比备用手绢轻。带上！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "Next time I'll unfold my map before I get honeyed carp on my fingers."
msgstr "下回吃蜜汁鲤鱼前先把地图摊开。这一手的蜜！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "Found a leg in my fillet. Did my dinner walk here?"
msgstr "鱼排里发现一条腿。我的晚餐自己走来的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Measured it twice. Yep, the leaf's longer than my arm."
msgstr "量了两遍。没错，这芦荟叶比我胳膊长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "My giant aloe's gone to soup. Anybody pack a ladle?"
msgstr "我的大芦荟烂成汤了。谁带汤勺了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "That radish would make great ballast. Edible ballast!"
msgstr "这大萝卜够沉，挂在气球底下能当沙袋。饿了还能吃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "That stink went right through the canvas. Next radish rides outside."
msgstr "隔着帆布包都闻得到萝卜的臭味。下回我把它挂包外头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "Here's my fee. Same supplies for the return trip, please."
msgstr "咕噜币给你。照这批再进点货，我返程时来拿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "The Pig King buys boats? Good. This one's short on legroom."
msgstr "猪王收船？太好了。这艘连伸腿的地方都没有。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "I can lift it. My balloon might have other ideas."
msgstr "我倒是举得动。我的气球恐怕有意见。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Fog bank ahead. Stay close to the fan. With that tailwind we'll still be on time."
msgstr "前面雾大，咱们靠风扇近点儿。有这股顺风，照样能准时到！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "Pollen in the filter! I usually find it with my nose."
msgstr "滤网上全是花粉。搁在平时，我早打喷嚏了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "A passenger with roots. Let's find you a landing spot."
msgstr "这位乘客长着根呢。给你找个地方着陆吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "One nettle seed. I've lost bigger things in these pockets."
msgstr "一粒荨麻籽。比它大的东西我都能在兜里弄丢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Roots down. I'll mark the spot on my map."
msgstr "扎下根了。我在地图上给你标个点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Flew in a bit early. I'll swing back around when it's growing season."
msgstr "看来我飞早了。等到了小树肯长个儿的季节，我再绕回来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "I'll try the desert. Plenty of sand for those roots."
msgstr "去沙漠试试。那儿有的是沙，够它扎根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Green shoots. I can spot those without my goggles."
msgstr "冒绿芽了。摘了风镜我都看得见。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Grounded for the winter, huh? I'll check in after the thaw."
msgstr "冬天停长，就跟我停飞一样。等开春我再来看你！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Rainforest soil. That's where I'd drop this one off."
msgstr "下一站，雨林。那儿的土才适合这株荨麻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "Still dry? Good thing I packed water for two."
msgstr "土还干着？我带了两人份的水，正好分你一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "A moon rock idol. The sculptor took particular care over the iris."
msgstr "月岩雕成的眼睛。瞧，连虹膜的纹路都刻出来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "It restores whole ruins. Quite a lot of history to fit in a seed."
msgstr "整座遗迹都能复原。这一粒种子里，竟容得下这么多历史。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "I see they've classified the wares. Now if only they'd label the rooms."
msgstr "看来他们已经把商品分了类。要是肯给各间屋子也挂个牌子就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "I see they've classified the wares. Now if only they'd label the rooms."
msgstr "看来他们已经把商品分了类。要是肯给各间屋子也挂个牌子就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "One need only sit down to visit another world. How very civilised."
msgstr "坐下来就能去另一个世界。这趟旅程倒是从容得很。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "All the parts of a travelling chair, including, I trust, the seat."
msgstr "旅行椅的零件都在这儿。让我看看，椅面也装进来了吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "The pellet appears to summon a tentacle made of shadow."
msgstr "这颗弹丸似乎能召来一条暗影触手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "The charge is released on impact. Mind where you aim, dear."
msgstr "打中就会炸开。亲爱的，瞄准时可要当心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "A solid alloy pellet. It ought to hold its shape nicely."
msgstr "实心合金做的弹丸，应该不容易变形。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "Hum. The nectar does little to disguise that distinctly bitter finish."
msgstr "唔，放了花蜜，咽下去还是有点苦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "A fork along the backbone first, dear. Carp have rather a lot of fine bones."
msgstr "亲爱的，先用叉子沿着鱼脊拨开鱼肉。鲤鱼的细刺可不少。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "The fish is easy to identify. The legs require a closer look."
msgstr "鱼肉倒是好认。至于这两条腿，得凑近些瞧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "A splendid succulent. Imagine how much water just one leaf holds."
msgstr "好一株多肉植物。单是一片叶子，就能存下不少水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "The leaf has rotted right through to the gel."
msgstr "这片芦荟叶连里头的凝胶都腐烂了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "My word. That taproot alone could fill a market basket."
msgstr "哎呀，光这条主根就能装满一只菜篮子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Radishes and cabbages are related. One can smell the family resemblance."
msgstr "水萝卜和卷心菜是一家。闻闻，烂了也是一个味儿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "The mayor permits repeat orders, provided one supplies the oincs."
msgstr "镇长准了。付上咕噜币，就能请店家再进同样的货。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "The Pig King's collection evidently extends to model boats."
msgstr "看来猪王连模型船也收藏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "Equal masses on either end keep the grip nicely balanced."
msgstr "两头的钢块一样重，握在正中间就稳当了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "The moving air keeps the fog from slowing anyone near WX."
msgstr "风扇吹开了雾。走在机器人身边的人也能照常赶路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "The fine grains of pollen are caught in the filter."
msgstr "细小的花粉颗粒都留在了滤网上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "A young tuber tree. I'd best get those roots back into soil."
msgstr "是棵块茎树苗，得趁早把露在外面的根种回土里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Nettle seeds. An envelope would keep them together nicely."
msgstr "荨麻籽这么小，用个信封装着就不会撒了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "The roots have taken hold. I'll leave them undisturbed."
msgstr "根已经扎稳，就让它安心长吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Healthy, merely dormant. Growth will resume in a warmer season."
msgstr "小树很健康，只是休眠了。等天暖些，自然会继续生长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "I'd try the painted sands. This soil doesn't suit its roots."
msgstr "我会试试彩绘沙地。这里的土不适合它扎根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Such tender green leaves on this young nettle."
msgstr "这株小荨麻的绿叶真嫩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Winter dormancy is quite normal for this nettle."
msgstr "这株荨麻入冬就会休眠，很正常。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Rainforest soil would better suit this specimen."
msgstr "这株荨麻更适合种在雨林里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "The soil has dried out again. A little more water, please."
msgstr "土又干了。请再浇一点水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "WHO TAUGHT THE MOON ROCK TO STARE? 'TIS RUDE!"
msgstr "谁教这块月岩瞪人的？真没规矩！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "UP, OLD RUIN WALLS! THIS LITTLE SEED COMMANDS IT!"
msgstr "小种子一声令下，遗迹的墙又站起来啦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "THREE ROOMS O' WARES! WHERE BE THE SWEETIES?"
msgstr "三间屋子全是货！哪间卖糖呀？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "THREE ROOMS O' WARES! WHERE BE THE SWEETIES?"
msgstr "三间屋子全是货！哪间卖糖呀？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "GOOD CHAIR, BEAR MINE BOTTOM TO YONDER WORLD!"
msgstr "椅子听令！带本公主去另一个世界！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "WILBA HATH ORDERED A CHAIR. WHO HATH ORDERED ALL THESE STICKS?"
msgstr "威尔巴订的可是椅子！谁给我送来一堆木条？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "YON SHADOW HATH A WIGGLY ARM!"
msgstr "那团影子长胳膊啦！还会扭呢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "ONE HIT AND OUT COMETH THE BOOM!"
msgstr "一打中就炸开，轰！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "CLINK! A PEA IN SHINING ARMOUR!"
msgstr "叮！好像一颗穿了盔甲的豌豆！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "BITTER! POLLEN AND VENOM, BEGONE!"
msgstr "好苦！花粉、毒液，统统退下！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "THE CARP DOTH WEAR ITS HONEY. NOW SO DOTH WILBA."
msgstr "这条鱼穿了件蜂蜜袍子！咦，我的蹄子上也沾了蜜！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "WHAT LEG DOTH HIDE IN MINE FISH? COME FORTH!"
msgstr "鱼排里怎么藏着条腿？出来见本公主！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "ONE LEAF CAN SHADE A WHOLE PRINCESS!"
msgstr "一片叶子就遮得住一整位公主！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "ALAS, BIG LEAF! THOU HAST GONE ALL SQUELCHY."
msgstr "可惜了这么大的芦荟叶，一捏就烂成泥了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "YON RADISH NEEDS A BIGGER CROWN THAN MINE!"
msgstr "我的王冠太小啦，这颗水萝卜根本戴不上！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "THY ROSY CHEEKS HATH CAVED IN. POO!"
msgstr "水萝卜，你的红脸蛋都瘪啦。好臭！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "TAKE THESE OINCS, GOOD PIG. MORE OF THE VERY SAME!"
msgstr "掌柜的，收下咕噜币！下回还进这种货，本公主喜欢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "A ROYAL FLEET! 'TIS SHORT BUT A CREW OF VERY LITTLE PIGS."
msgstr "皇家船队在此！只缺一群很小很小的猪水手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "MINE HOOFS SAY THIS IRON MAY STAY ON THE FLOOR."
msgstr "我的蹄子说啦，这块铁还是放地上好！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "PUFF AWAY THE FOG! MINE FRIENDS WOULD MARCH!"
msgstr "风扇，把雾吹开！让我的朋友们也能大步走过去！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "CATCH YON POLLEN ERE IT TICKLETH MINE SNOUT!"
msgstr "滤网，快拦住花粉！本公主的鼻子怕痒！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "A TREE SO WEE IT FITS 'TWIXT MINE HOOFS!"
msgstr "好小的树苗呀！我用两只蹄子就能捧住！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "THOU ART TOO WEE TO STING YET, LITTLE SEED."
msgstr "小荨麻籽，你还没长刺，扎不着我！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "ITS ROOTY TOES DOTH GRIP THE EARTH!"
msgstr "瞧，小树根像脚趾头一样，紧紧抓住了泥土！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "NOT YET THY SEASON, LITTLE TREE. WILBA GIVETH THEE A HOLIDAY!"
msgstr "小树，现在还不是你长高的时候。本公主准你放个假！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "WOULDST THOU LIKE A BED O' PAINTED SAND?"
msgstr "这里的土不合你心意？那就把你种在彩绘沙地上！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "LOOK! A WEE GREEN CROWN FOR THE DIRT!"
msgstr "荨麻冒芽啦！瞧，泥巴也戴上小绿王冠了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "LET WINTER FINISH SPEAKING, THEN GROW!"
msgstr "冬天还没退场呢。小荨麻，等过了冬再长！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "YON NETTLE WOULD DWELL IN RAINFOREST SOIL."
msgstr "这株小荨麻想搬去雨林的泥地里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "ANOTHER DRINK FOR THE LITTLE GREEN LADY!"
msgstr "小荨麻渴啦！快给这位绿裙小姑娘再倒点水！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "Hey, I can see my flame in its pupil. Hold still, eyeball!"
msgstr "嘿，它瞳孔里映着我的火苗。眼珠子，别动！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "I wreck the ruins, this puts 'em back. I like this seed."
msgstr "有这颗种子，遗迹砸坏了也能变回原样。嘿，我喜欢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Three rooms! Bet the pigs keep the good stuff in the last one."
msgstr "三间屋子！我敢打赌，那帮猪把好东西都藏在最里头了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Three rooms! Bet the pigs keep the good stuff in the last one."
msgstr "三间屋子！我敢打赌，那帮猪把好东西都藏在最里头了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Dibs on the flying chair! Later, world!"
msgstr "飞椅我先坐！我去别的世界兜风啦，回见！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "Poke me with that chair leg again and see what happens."
msgstr "喂，拼椅子的时候看着点！你再拿椅子腿戳我一下试试！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "Keep those shadow tentacles on YOUR end of the slingshot."
msgstr "把弹弓拿远点！别让那些暗影触手伸到我这边来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "It goes bang when it hits? Gimme two."
msgstr "打中了会炸？给我来两颗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "Bet that metal pellet puts a sweet dent in a helmet."
msgstr "这颗金属弹打在头盔上，准能砸出个漂亮的坑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "Blech! How does a cute little flower taste that bitter? If it didn't keep poison and pollen off my back, I'd pass!"
msgstr "这么好看的花，怎么这么苦？要不是能防毒、挡花粉，我才不吃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "First the honey, then the sour kicks in. Sneaky fish."
msgstr "刚尝到蜂蜜味……嘶，好酸！这鱼还挺会偷袭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "Hey, who snuck a pair of legs into my fish?"
msgstr "喂，谁偷偷往我的鱼排里塞了两条腿？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "One leaf and I'm up to my elbows in goo."
msgstr "才掰一片叶子，黏糊糊的汁就沾到我胳膊肘了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "The whole aloe's leaking. Ugh, my boots!"
msgstr "烂芦荟还在往外淌汁。啧，都流我靴子上了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "That much radish oughta make my nose smoke."
msgstr "这么大个水萝卜，吃完我鼻子都得辣冒烟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "I poked the radish. My finger went right through. Bleh."
msgstr "我戳了下萝卜，手指直接穿过去了。呕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "Here's my oincs. Same thing back on that shelf, got it?"
msgstr "咕噜币给你。卖光了还进这种货，听见没？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "Bernie, captain the boat. I'll handle the lighthouse!"
msgstr "伯尼，你来当船长。灯塔的火我包了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "That's a lot of iron just to make your arm hurt."
msgstr "用这么大块铁，就为了让自己胳膊酸？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Hey, wind-up! Keep that fan close. I'm sick of slogging through fog."
msgstr "喂，铁皮脑袋，带着风扇靠近点！我可不想在雾里一步一挪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "Heh. Let the filter get a noseful of pollen for once."
msgstr "嘿，这回让花粉去堵滤网，别堵我的鼻子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "This little tree keeps tickling my wrist. Dirt for you."
msgstr "小树苗挠得我手腕发痒。你还是进土里吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "All that sting packed into these itty-bitty seeds?"
msgstr "就这几颗小籽，能长出那么扎人的荨麻？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "I gave it a tug. Yep, those roots are in."
msgstr "我拽了一下。嗯，根扎牢了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Wrong season for this tree. It likes summer, though. Heh, me too."
msgstr "嫌现在季节不对？行啊，小树，我也盼着夏天呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Picky roots. How about some nice volcanic dirt?"
msgstr "树根还挑土？给你换点火山土怎么样？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey, a green leaf! Let's see if it stings yet."
msgstr "嘿，长绿叶了！试试看扎不扎人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "It's sitting winter out. Scoot over, nettle."
msgstr "过完冬才肯长？行啊，小荨麻，我也想躲个冬天。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "You want rainforest dirt? You could've said so sooner."
msgstr "你要雨林那种土？早说嘛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "Even I think that's too dry. Where'd I leave the watering can?"
msgstr "连我都觉得这土太干了。我把浇水壶搁哪儿了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "Who carved that eye? I'd hate to have it for a shift boss."
msgstr "这眼睛谁雕的？要让它来监工，可真够我受的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "Rebuild a whole ruin with that? There goes my overtime."
msgstr "靠它就能重修整座遗迹？得，我的加班费泡汤了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Three rooms of stock. Bet those pigs do some heavy liftin'."
msgstr "三间屋的货都得搬进来。猪伙计们没少出力啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Three rooms of stock. Bet those pigs do some heavy liftin'."
msgstr "三间屋的货都得搬进来。猪伙计们没少出力啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Sit tight, gang. This chair's headed clean outta this world."
msgstr "伙计们，坐稳喽。这把椅子可要飞到另一个世界去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "Lay the parts out first. Nobody likes a spare screw at the end."
msgstr "先把零件摆开。谁也不想装完还剩颗螺丝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "Hard hats, gang! Those shadow arms don't watch where they swing."
msgstr "伙计们，戴好安全帽！那几条暗影触手甩起来可不看下面有没有人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "Goes bang when it hits. Goggles on, gang."
msgstr "打中就炸。伙计们，护目镜戴好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "Good solid alloy. You can feel the heft of it."
msgstr "结实的合金。上手一掂就知道有分量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "Try sneezing with a mouthful of nails. Yep, I'll keep a pinch of this handy."
msgstr "你试试嘴里叼着钉子的时候打喷嚏？得，这药我带上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "Pass the bread. I'm moppin' up that honey sauce."
msgstr "面包递一下。这鱼盘里的蜜汁我可得蘸干净。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "Hey, whoever packed those legs into the fish owes me a bigger fork."
msgstr "嘿，谁往鱼肚子里塞了两条腿？这下得换把大叉子了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "One leaf's enough to patch up a whole shift's worth of scraped elbows."
msgstr "谁干活时蹭破了皮就来抹点。光这片芦荟叶就够咱们全班用！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Grab a bucket. That big aloe's coming apart in my hands."
msgstr "拿个桶来。这大芦荟烂得我都捧不住了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Lunch is on me. Who wants the other half of my radish?"
msgstr "午饭我请。这大萝卜我吃一半，另一半谁要？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Anybody got a shovel? This radish is past the knife stage."
msgstr "谁有铲子？这萝卜烂成泥了，哪还用得上菜刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "Now that's how you stock a spare-parts shelf. Use the last one, order another."
msgstr "备件架就该这么管。用掉最后一个，照样再订一个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "Nice little hull. Let's see what the Pig King pays for workmanship."
msgstr "这小船做得挺扎实。去问问猪王，这手艺值多少钱？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "Feels like hauling steel at work. At least this one's got a handle."
msgstr "跟我上班搬的钢料一样沉。好在这个带把手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Stick with WX. That fan cuts us a path through the fog."
msgstr "跟紧机器人！有它那台风扇开路，大伙儿就好走多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "Now that's a filter! Catches the pollen before it hits your nose."
msgstr "这滤网才像话！花粉还没到鼻子就给拦住了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Hold the little tree upright for me. I'll get the shovel."
msgstr "帮我把这棵小树扶正。我去拿铲子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Hold out your hand. There's a whole patch of nettles in these few specks."
msgstr "手摊开。别看荨麻籽就这么几粒，能种出一大片呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "That's got a good grip on the ground. Nice work, roots."
msgstr "嘿，小树扎根了，抓得还挺牢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "No point rushin' it. This one's waiting on warmer weather."
msgstr "催也白催。这棵树得等天暖了才肯长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Let's move it. I've seen 'em take in that painted sand."
msgstr "换个地儿吧。我见过这种树在彩绘沙地上扎根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Look at those little green leaves. Hands off, though!"
msgstr "瞧那几片嫩绿叶子。手可别凑上去！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Guess the nettles are takin' the winter off."
msgstr "看来荨麻也放冬假啦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Wrong patch for this job. Get me some rainforest turf."
msgstr "这块地不合用。给我找块雨林地皮来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "Dry again? Pass me the watering can."
msgstr "又干啦？把浇水壶递我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "Is moon rock watching? Wolfgang better stick chest out."
msgstr "那只石眼在看沃尔夫冈？那得把胸挺起来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "Little seed can rebuild whole anthill? Would take Wolfgang many shovels."
msgstr "小种子能重建整个蚁丘？换沃尔夫冈来，得挖坏好几把铲子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Three rooms of shopping? Good thing you brought man with big arms!"
msgstr "三间屋子都要逛？尽管买，沃尔夫冈帮你们扛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Three rooms of shopping? Good thing you brought man with big arms!"
msgstr "三间屋子都要逛？尽管买，沃尔夫冈帮你们扛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Chair carries Wolfgang to next world? Usually Wolfgang carries chair."
msgstr "椅子扛着沃尔夫冈去另一个世界？平常都是沃尔夫冈扛椅子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "Big pieces go here. Who has little screws?"
msgstr "椅子的大零件放这儿。谁拿着那几颗小螺丝？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "Shadow is growing long arms. No, Wolfgang will not wrestle it."
msgstr "影子伸出了长胳膊。不，沃尔夫冈才不跟它摔跤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "Tiny shot hits, then BOOM! Like big circus drum."
msgstr "小弹丸一打中就炸响。咚！像马戏团的大鼓！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "Squeeze with whole fist. Metal ball stays round!"
msgstr "好硬的合金弹！使这么大劲儿都捏不扁！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "Wolfgang only takes tiny pinch. Oof! So bitter it makes tongue curl!"
msgstr "沃尔夫冈只尝了一小撮。嚯！舌头都苦得打卷了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "Is sweet fish. Oof! Sour part makes whole face pucker."
msgstr "第一口是甜的。嚯！第二口酸得整张脸都皱起来了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "Fish comes with two legs. Is very good day for hungry strongman."
msgstr "鱼还配两条腿。饿肚子的大力士今天有口福了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Look! Aloe leaf is wider than strongman's belt."
msgstr "看！芦荟叶比大力士的腰带还宽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Wolfgang lifts aloe. Only handful of mush comes up."
msgstr "这么大的芦荟，伸手一提，就只捞到一把烂叶子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "One slice of radish fills whole plate. Big plate!"
msgstr "这萝卜，切一片就能铺满一个盘子。大盘子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Cannot roll this radish now. One push and it goes splat."
msgstr "萝卜滚不动了。推一下就烂成一摊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "Here's mayor's note and oincs. Order more of same, pig friend! Wolfgang carry crates."
msgstr "镇长的条子和咕噜币都给你。再进一批同样的货，箱子我来扛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "Wolfgang can carry whole ship on one finger. Folks in back row cannot see how small it is!"
msgstr "沃尔夫冈一根手指就能托起整艘船。后排的看不出船有多小！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "Good thick iron handle. Now, hundred more with left hand!"
msgstr "好粗的铁把手。来，换左手再举一百下！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Walk beside fan, friends! Even in fog we take big steps."
msgstr "朋友们，跟紧装了风扇的机器人！雾再大也能迈开步子走！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "Ah... ah... where did big sneeze go? Little screen caught the pollen!"
msgstr "啊……啊……咦，没打出喷嚏？小滤网把花粉全挡住了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Can carry whole tree in one hand. For now."
msgstr "一只手就能托起整棵树。趁它还小。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Big fingers, tiny nettle seeds. Must count very carefully."
msgstr "粗手指，小荨麻籽。要一粒一粒仔细数。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Good grip on ground, little tree!"
msgstr "根扎得真牢！小树，好力气！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Rest now, little tree! Summer is good season to grow big."
msgstr "这季节不长个？先歇歇，小树！夏天可是长个子的好时候。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Will find you good sandy ground, like in desert."
msgstr "给你找块好沙地，就找沙漠那种。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Two green leaves up like tiny fists. Ready!"
msgstr "绿叶举起来，像两只小拳头。准备好了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Little nettle takes winter off. Training starts after."
msgstr "小荨麻冬天休息。过完冬再开练。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Need rainforest ground. Wolfgang can carry some!"
msgstr "得用雨林的土。沃尔夫冈去扛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "Little nettle is thirsty! Fill watering can right up. Wolfgang can lift it!"
msgstr "小荨麻渴坏了。把浇水壶装满，沃尔夫冈提得动！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "Looks like a knot in a log. Still don't like it eyeballin' me."
msgstr "活像木头上的节疤。它老这么瞅我，我可不自在。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "This seed brings the ruins back? Wish it'd work on my woodpile."
msgstr "这籽能让遗迹恢复原样？要是对我的柴堆也管用就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Three rooms of shelves. Somebody did a lot of sawing."
msgstr "三间屋子都摆满了货架，这得锯多少木头啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Three rooms of shelves. Somebody did a lot of sawing."
msgstr "三间屋子都摆满了货架，这得锯多少木头啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Sit down here, stand up in another world. Beats walking."
msgstr "在这儿坐下，到另一个世界起身。省脚力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "Easy, Luce. Those chair legs are already cut to size."
msgstr "露西，不用再锯了。这几条椅子腿长短正合适。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "That tentacle's wriggling in my pocket."
msgstr "那根触手在我兜里直扭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "She'll go bang when she hits. Heads up, eh?"
msgstr "这颗弹丸打中东西就炸。都当心点啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "Solid metal. Feel the heft of that little fella."
msgstr "实心金属的。这小家伙还挺压手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "A pinch of this herb for my stew, Lucy. Hate to sneeze halfway through a swing."
msgstr "露西，炖菜里得加点半边莲。斧子抡到一半，我可不想打喷嚏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "Fish is gone. Still got half the honey in my beard."
msgstr "鱼吃完了，一半的蜂蜜还挂在胡子上呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "I'll take the fish. Those legs look a little too birdy."
msgstr "鱼归我。那两条腿怎么看着像鸟腿呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "One leaf'd fill my canteen with aloe juice."
msgstr "这么大一片叶子，芦荟汁够灌满我的水壶。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Grabbed a leaf. Came away with a fistful of mush."
msgstr "伸手拽了片叶子，糊了一手烂芦荟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Might want a stump to sit on while I peel this one."
msgstr "削这萝卜的皮，我得先找个树墩坐下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Rolled it over. Should've left the smelly side down."
msgstr "早知道就不翻这烂萝卜了。臭的那面本来朝下呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "Here you go, shopkeep. Same goods next time, eh?"
msgstr "老板，咕噜币给你。下回还进这种货啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "One piece of wood, from bow to stern. Somebody spent a good winter on this."
msgstr "这小船从头到尾都是一整块木头削的。这人的冬天可没闲着。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "Heavy as a wet log. At least this one's got a handle."
msgstr "跟湿木头一般沉。好在这玩意儿有个把手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Hear that fan, Lucy? Stick with the robot and we'll be home through the fog by supper."
msgstr "听见风扇响没，露西？跟紧机器人，雾再大咱也能赶回去吃晚饭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "Catches the pollen before it gets into my whiskers."
msgstr "花粉还没沾上我的胡子就给滤掉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Hang on, little tree. I'll find you a patch of ground."
msgstr "小树苗，再等等。我给你找块地儿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Careful with that nettle seed. There's a hole in my pocket."
msgstr "这颗荨麻籽得攥紧了，我兜上有个洞。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Roots have a good grip now."
msgstr "这棵树苗算是扎稳根了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Bit early to count rings, Lucy. It's not the growing season yet."
msgstr "还没到这树苗长个儿的季节呢。露西，现在惦记数年轮可早了点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "I'd try that patch of desert dirt."
msgstr "这地儿不合适。我看把树苗挪到沙漠里种吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Little green leaves. Better mind where I put my boots."
msgstr "刚冒出几片绿叶。下脚可得当心了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Winter's for splittin' wood. That nettle can wait it out."
msgstr "冬天正好劈柴。这棵荨麻等开春再长吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "This nettle belongs on rainforest turf."
msgstr "这棵荨麻该栽在雨林的地上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "Soil's dry. Got a drop left in my canteen for this nettle."
msgstr "土都干了。我壶里还剩一口水，给这棵荨麻浇上吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "One eye on me gold. Face the wall, moon rock."
msgstr "就一只眼，还盯着俺的金子。月岩，朝墙看！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "This puts the old ruins back in shipshape? Fetch me loot sack!"
msgstr "这颗籽能把老遗迹整回原样？快把俺的财宝袋拿来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Three holds full o' cargo, an' the pigs charge fer every bit."
msgstr "满满三舱货，这帮猪一件都不肯白给。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Three holds full o' cargo, an' the pigs charge fer every bit."
msgstr "满满三舱货，这帮猪一件都不肯白给。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Set course fer another world! Me pegs could use the sit-down."
msgstr "坐着就能朝另一个世界启航？正好让俺这双木腿歇歇！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "Pass me the fittings. This sky chair won't rig herself."
msgstr "把零件递来。这把上天的椅子得俺亲手装。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "A wee kraken arm, black as the deep."
msgstr "这条触手黑得跟深海似的。哪只小海怪掉的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "Bursts on the first hit. Wee thing's got a cannon's temper!"
msgstr "打中就炸，这小家伙脾气跟大炮一样冲！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "Fine alloy shot. Rings true against me coin."
msgstr "拿俺的咕噜币敲敲这合金弹。听，多脆！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "Bitter as bilge. Stow some fer pollen an' venom."
msgstr "苦得像舱底水。留点儿，对付花粉跟毒液。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "Sweet carp! Scrape that last dab o' honey off me plate."
msgstr "好甜的鲤鱼！盘底那点蜜也给俺刮干净。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "A leg below decks in me fish. Stowaway!"
msgstr "鱼肚子里藏着条腿。嘿，逮着个偷渡的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "That aloe leaf'd put me mainsail to shame."
msgstr "这芦荟叶一张开，俺的主帆都显小了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Leakin' green slop all over me deck. Overboard wi' ye!"
msgstr "绿汁淌得满甲板都是。快把这烂芦荟扔下船！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Feed a whole watch off that one radish."
msgstr "光这一个水萝卜就够一班水手吃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "One rotten radish an' I can smell it from the masthead."
msgstr "就烂了一个萝卜，俺爬到桅顶都闻得见。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "The mayor's seal an' me oincs, lad. Same cargo next time I make port."
msgstr "掌柜的，镇长盖了章，咕噜币俺也付了。下回靠港，俺还要这种货！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "She'll fetch more from the Pig King than she will in freight."
msgstr "这小船拿去跟猪王换，比拿来运货赚得多。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "Heave! That much iron'll put a bend in me pegs."
msgstr "嘿哟！这铁疙瘩沉得快把俺的木腿压弯了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Close up, mates! In this fan's breeze the fog can't slow us."
msgstr "伙计们，靠拢！跟着风扇走，雾再大也耽误不了咱们赶路！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "Catches pollen like herrin' in a net."
msgstr "俺的渔网捞鲱鱼，这张滤网捞花粉。一粒也跑不了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "A wee tuber mast wi' the roots still danglin'."
msgstr "这树苗活像根小桅杆，底下还拖着几条根呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Nettle seed. One gust an' she'll be overboard."
msgstr "荨麻籽，得攥住。一阵风就能给它刮下船。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Roots holdin' fast. Who taught ye to drop anchor?"
msgstr "根扎得这么牢。小树苗，你跟哪位船长学的抛锚？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "She waits fer her growin' season, same as I wait fer a fair wind."
msgstr "小树也得等季节，就跟俺出港要等顺风一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "She wants a sandy berth. Steer fer the painted dunes."
msgstr "树苗在这儿长不大。转舵，送它去彩绘沙地！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Flyin' her first green pennant, she is."
msgstr "看见那片嫩叶没？小苗升绿旗啦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Moored fer the winter. She'll sail after the thaw."
msgstr "小荨麻抛锚过冬喽。等开春再接着长！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Wrong port. Fetch her some rainforest soil."
msgstr "靠错港了，伙计。这株荨麻得种在雨林的土里！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "Dry as ship's biscuit. Another dipper o' water, mate."
msgstr "干得跟船上的硬饼一样。伙计，再来一瓢水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "Moon rock has eye. Hello in there!"
msgstr "月岩上有只眼睛。你好！里面有人吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "Stone rooms grow back? Funny seed."
msgstr "这颗种子能让石头房子长回来？真怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Three rooms. Pig smell in all three."
msgstr "三间屋。间间都有小猪味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Three rooms. Pig smell in all three."
msgstr "三间屋。间间都有小猪味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Sit here. Wake up under new sky?"
msgstr "坐上去。一睁眼，就到另一个世界了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "Sitting thing in pieces. Needs help."
msgstr "椅子还散着呢。来，帮你拼好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "Dark wiggly arms inside?"
msgstr "里面有条黑触手？好像动了一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "Bumps into thing. Bursts like pod!"
msgstr "碰到东西，啪！像种荚裂开。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "Metal pea. Too hard to chew."
msgstr "铁豆豆。咬不动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "Bitter leaf dust. Keeps sneezy dust and poison away."
msgstr "苦苦的叶子粉。吃了不怕花粉，也不怕毒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "Buzz Juice on Glub Glub. Smells sour too."
msgstr "小鱼身上沾了蜂蜜。闻着还有点酸。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "Glub Glub outside. Little leg inside."
msgstr "外面是鱼。鱼肚子里藏了条腿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "So much drink in one leaf!"
msgstr "一片叶子里，这么多水！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Leaf split. Just a puddle now."
msgstr "叶子烂开了。只剩一摊水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Can't fit arms around red root."
msgstr "好大的萝卜。两只手都抱不过来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Red friend going soft. Dirt can have a turn."
msgstr "萝卜软了。泥土，这回给你吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "Give piggy oincs. Shelf grows same thing again?"
msgstr "给小猪咕噜币。货架上又会长出一样的东西？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "Baby Floaty. Big piggy trade for it?"
msgstr "好小的船。猪王肯拿东西换吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "Heavy. Makes branches droop."
msgstr "好沉。枝条都垂下来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Robot blows. Friends can walk through fog!"
msgstr "铁皮朋友把雾吹开了。跟紧它，好走多了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "Robot nose catches flower dust."
msgstr "铁皮鼻子把花粉兜住了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Little tree. Roots hanging out. Here, hold on."
msgstr "小树，根露在外面了。来，先抓住我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Prickly friend's babies. Still in seed coats."
msgstr "荨麻籽。小荨麻还在壳里睡呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Roots holding dirt. Happy here."
msgstr "根抱紧了泥土。小树喜欢这儿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Waiting for warm growing days."
msgstr "小树别急。等季节暖和了再长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Roots want desert dirt. Can find some."
msgstr "根想要沙漠土。去找找。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Hello, little green pokers!"
msgstr "绿叶子，带小刺。你好呀，小荨麻！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Sleeping through winter. Shh."
msgstr "嘘，小荨麻睡了。过完冬再长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Miss the rainforest dirt, friend?"
msgstr "想雨林的泥土了，朋友？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "Leaves drooping. Bringing water!"
msgstr "叶子耷拉了。渴了吧？我去拿水！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "I gave the moon rock a wink. It owes me one."
msgstr "我冲月岩眨了下眼。嘿，该你眨啦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "What sprouts in the ruins? The ruins again!"
msgstr "猜猜这颗种子能让什么长回来？整座遗迹！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Three rooms to a shop! Guess which one I'm hiding in?"
msgstr "一家店，三间房！你猜我往哪间藏？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Three rooms to a shop! Guess which one I'm hiding in?"
msgstr "一家店，三间房！你猜我往哪间藏？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "I'll sit quite still and let the world skip out from under me."
msgstr "我坐着不动也能换个世界。嘿，这回轮到世界蹦啦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "A heap for a leap! Now where did I put the seat?"
msgstr "拼好这堆零件就能出发啦。咦，我把椅面搁哪儿了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "Lend me a hand? A tentacle will do."
msgstr "谁来搭把手？哦，触手也行！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "One little knock and POP goes the shot!"
msgstr "轻轻一碰，砰！弹丸炸开花！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "A little metal pea. Watch your teeth, hyuyu!"
msgstr "像颗豌豆吧？嘿嘿，这颗可是金属的，当心牙！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "Shoo, pollen! Shoo, venom! Pah, who'll shoo the bitter taste?"
msgstr "躲得过花粉，躲得过毒，怎么就躲不过这口苦味？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "Honey, then vinegar. Who turned my grin into a pucker?"
msgstr "先尝到蜜，再尝到醋。嘿，谁把我的笑脸变成了酸脸？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "A fish with a leg! Did it walk to the table?"
msgstr "这鱼还带条腿！莫非是自己走上桌的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Squeeze that leaf and I'll be slick from horn to heel."
msgstr "这叶子一挤，流出来的汁够我从角尖抹到蹄子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "The goo got loose. There go my hooves!"
msgstr "黏汁流一地，我的蹄子要打滑！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Hold it to my face. How's that for a clown nose?"
msgstr "把这萝卜往鼻子上一比，哪个小丑的红鼻头有我的大？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "I tried to pinch it. It oozed right through my claws!"
msgstr "本想顺走个萝卜，谁知一捏就烂成泥，全从爪缝里漏啦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "An oinc for an encore! The same goods, if you please."
msgstr "拿好咕噜币，掌柜的！这件货卖完，劳驾再变一件上架！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "Off to trade with the Pig King! Two claws to carry my ship, and both will stay dry!"
msgstr "拎着小船找猪王换宝贝去喽！两根指头就提得动，连爪子都不用沾水！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "My, this iron plays a very heavy tune. Thud."
msgstr "听听这铁家伙落地唱什么调。咚！就会这一声？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Trot beside the tin one. Even the fog can't trip us!"
msgstr "跟着铁皮伙计跑，浓雾也绊不着脚！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "All that pollen, and the tin nose won't give me one little sneeze?"
msgstr "这么多花粉都让铁鼻子拦住啦？嘿，连个喷嚏也听不着！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Its roots are tickling the palm of my paw."
msgstr "根须挠得我爪心好痒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Do nettles practice stinging inside these little shells?"
msgstr "荨麻籽还没发芽呢，就在壳里练习扎人啦？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Those roots hold tight. I'll let the little tree win at tug."
msgstr "根抓得真牢。这场拔河就让小树赢吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Still waiting for the warm season to make its entrance, I see."
msgstr "小树要等暖和的季节才肯长。好大的架子呀！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "My hooves vote for painted sand. Do the roots agree?"
msgstr "我喜欢踩彩绘沙地。小树，你也想去那儿扎根吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Such a small green sprig to play so sharp a trick!"
msgstr "小荨麻才冒头就会恶作剧啦。哎哟，扎到我了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Dream up some mischief till winter's done."
msgstr "小荨麻，过完冬再长吧。梦里先想想下回扎谁！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Shall I fetch you a patch of rainforest floor?"
msgstr "要我给你捎块雨林地皮来吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "A drink for the nettle! I'll pour at the end that can't sting."
msgstr "来，给你的根浇点水。扎人的那头可别凑过来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "Look like fishy eye. Me turn it so it can see pond."
msgstr "长得像鱼眼睛。我把它转过来，给它看看池塘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "It brings whole anthill back? Even the bitey ones?"
msgstr "这颗种子能把整座蚁丘变回来？连那些咬人的蚂蚁也回来？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "Pigfolk need three rooms to sell stuff? Bet one just for snacks."
msgstr "猪人卖东西要占三间屋？肯定有一间专门藏零嘴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Pigfolk need three rooms to sell stuff? Bet one just for snacks."
msgstr "猪人卖东西要占三间屋？肯定有一间专门藏零嘴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "Me get first ride! Maybe next world got bigger swamp!"
msgstr "我要第一个坐！没准那边的世界有更大的沼泽！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "How me sit on that? Chair still in pieces!"
msgstr "这要怎么坐？椅子还是一块一块的呢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "Hide a tentacle in there? Good swamp trick!"
msgstr "弹丸里藏了条触手？嘿嘿，我们沼泽就爱玩这招！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "Goes bang when it hits. Aim away from pond!"
msgstr "打中就炸。别往鱼塘瞄！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "Clink! Bet that one could dent a Pigfolk helmet."
msgstr "铛！这一发准能在猪人的头盔上砸出个坑！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "Keeps flower dust and poison away? Me try... bleh! So bitter! Look at my face!"
msgstr "能挡花粉，还能防毒？我尝尝……呸，苦得我脸都皱起来啦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "Who poured honey on fishy? Honey goes on carrots!"
msgstr "谁往小鱼身上浇蜂蜜？蜂蜜该浇在胡萝卜上！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "Fishy had fins already! Who stuffed a leg in there?!"
msgstr "小鱼本来就有鳍！谁又往它肚里塞了条腿？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "One leaf each. Biggest one for whoever grew it!"
msgstr "一人分一片叶子。最大的那片给种芦荟的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Poor aloe. Tried to pick it up. Got green mush."
msgstr "可怜的芦荟。一捧起来，手上全是绿糊糊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Me carry leaves. You push radish. We share!"
msgstr "我提叶子，你推萝卜。一起分着吃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Who let good radish go squishy? We coulda fed whole village!"
msgstr "谁把好萝卜放烂啦？本来够全村吃呢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "Here, piggy. Same veggies on shelf next time. Promise?"
msgstr "给你钱，小猪。下回架上还摆这种菜。说好啦？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "Silly pig king only want boat. Best part is fishies swimming underneath!"
msgstr "猪王就知道看船。船底下游来游去的小鱼才好看呢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "Can lift it! Just... need other claw too."
msgstr "我举得动！等一下……我得用两只爪子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "Stay with Ironfolk! Fog can't slow us now!"
msgstr "跟紧铁皮人！雾再大，咱也走得快！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "Ironfolk's filter caught all the flower dust! Don't shake it on me!"
msgstr "花粉都卡在铁皮人的滤网上啦！嘿，别往我这儿抖！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Me hold little tree steady. You dig!"
msgstr "我扶好小树，你来挖坑！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "These grow into nettles? Me want whole patch!"
msgstr "这些籽能长出荨麻？我要种满一大片！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Look! Roots grabbing on all by themselves!"
msgstr "看，小树扎根了！这回不用我扶啦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Little tree not growing this season? Fine! We see who taller when it grows again!"
msgstr "现在不长个儿？好，我等你能长的时候再来比谁高！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Want painted sand? Picky little tree."
msgstr "想要彩绘沙地？小树真挑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Two green leaves! Me can count the next ones too."
msgstr "两片绿叶啦！再长一片就是三片，我会数！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Winter too cold for nettle. Me can wait."
msgstr "荨麻嫌冬天冷。我等得起。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Rainforest dirt! Me know that smell. Need some here."
msgstr "荨麻喜欢雨林的土。我认得那味儿，去挖点来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "Back in a bit, nettle! Getting you a whole bucket!"
msgstr "荨麻，等我一会儿！给你提一整桶水来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.VORTEXEYE"
msgid "AN UNBLINKING STONE EYE. FINALLY, A WORTHY OPPONENT"
msgstr "一只不眨的石眼。总算遇到瞪眼的对手了"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SEEDOFRUIN"
msgid "A RESET BUTTON FOR RUINS. EVEN THE ANTS HAVE ONE"
msgstr "遗迹可以重置。连蚁丘都有重置键"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_SHOP"
msgid "THREE ROOMS TO EXTRACT COINS FROM ONE CUSTOMER"
msgstr "开了三间铺面，就为了赚我几枚咕噜币"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_SKYWORTHY"
msgid "THREE ROOMS TO EXTRACT COINS FROM ONE CUSTOMER"
msgstr "开了三间铺面，就为了赚我几枚咕噜币"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY"
msgid "I CAN LEAVE THIS WORLD WITHOUT STANDING UP. EXCELLENT"
msgstr "坐着就能离开这个世界。很好"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SKYWORTHY_KIT"
msgid "SOME ASSEMBLY BETWEEN ME AND A BETTER WORLD"
msgstr "把椅子装好，就能换个更好的世界。值得"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SHADOW"
msgid "PORTABLE SHADOW TENTACLES. NOW I CAN SWAT THINGS FROM OVER HERE"
msgstr "便携式暗影触手。现在隔着老远也能抽它们一下"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_INFUSED"
msgid "IMPACT FOLLOWED BY A BOOM. I APPROVE OF THE SEQUENCE"
msgstr "先撞击，再爆炸。我赞成这个顺序"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ALLOY"
msgid "SOLID ALLOY. THE TARGET CAN SUPPLY THE DENT"
msgstr "实心合金。挨砸的靶子才会凹下去"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SPICE_LOTUS"
msgid "A FLOWER THAT FIXES HAY FEVER. IT MAY CONTINUE TO EXIST"
msgstr "用花治花粉症。批准这朵花继续生长"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SWEETANDSOURCARP"
msgid "THE CARP IS LEAKING HONEY. AN IMPROVEMENT"
msgstr "鲤鱼在漏蜂蜜。比漏别的强"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL_HAMLET"
msgid "SOMEONE FITTED LEGS TO MY FISH"
msgstr "有人给我的鱼装了腿"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "GIANT LEAVES. MOSTLY WATER. KEEP YOUR DISTANCE"
msgstr "巨型叶片。主要成分是水。离我远点"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.ALOE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "THE ALOE CONTAINER HAS FAILED. NOW IT LEAKS"
msgstr "外壳烂穿。芦荟开始漏水"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED"
msgid "A ROOT THE SIZE OF MY HEAD. STILL NO PROCESSOR"
msgstr "根长得和我的头一样大。连个处理器都没有"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.RADISH_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "THE RADISH HAS LOST AN ARGUMENT WITH MICROBES"
msgstr "萝卜跟微生物较量了一场。输了"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SHOPLOCKER"
msgid "INSERT OINCS. PIG REPEATS LAST ORDER"
msgstr "投入咕噜币。猪店主会再进同样的货"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "THE PIG KING PAYS FOR A BOAT EVEN HE CAN'T BOARD"
msgstr "猪王肯花钱买一条连他自己都上不去的船"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_IRON"
msgid "NO UPGRADE SLOTS? ENJOY LIFTING STEEL, FLESHLINGS"
msgstr "没有升级槽？肉袋们，慢慢举铁吧"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FAN"
msgid "STAY IN MY DRAFT IF YOU WANT TO KEEP UP IN THE FOG"
msgstr "跟紧我的风扇。进了雾你们也能跟上"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_PORKLANDREBALANCE_FILTER"
msgid "POLLEN DENIED ENTRY. SNEEZE ELSEWHERE"
msgstr "花粉一律拦下。要打喷嚏去别处"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "A PORTABLE TREE. INSTALL ROOT END FIRST"
msgstr "便携式树木。安装时根部朝下"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "NETTLES IN THEIR MOST COMPACT FORMAT"
msgstr "整株荨麻，压缩成了一颗籽"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "ROOT CONNECTION ESTABLISHED"
msgstr "树根已接入地面"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "GROWTH PAUSED. WAKE ME WHEN IT GETS WARM"
msgstr "生长暂停。天暖了再叫我"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TUBER_TREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "GROUND INCOMPATIBLE. TRY DESERT SAND"
msgstr "土壤不兼容。换沙漠地皮"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "TINY GREEN STINGING APPARATUS COMING ONLINE"
msgstr "小绿叶已长出。扎人功能启动中"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "WINTER HAS SUSPENDED NETTLE PRODUCTION"
msgstr "冬季来临。荨麻暂停生长"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "THIS MODEL REQUIRES RAINFOREST TURF"
msgstr "此型号需要雨林地皮"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_SAPLING.WRONG_TOODRY"
msgid "IT DEMANDS WATER. I NOMINATE SOMEONE ELSE"
msgstr "荨麻缺水。浇水任务交给别人"

